    "Two schema details deserve special attention.\n",
    "\n",
    "First, the pitch coordinates live on a $120 \\times 80$ grid. In StatsBomb open data, larger $x$ values are farther upfield and larger $y$ values move from the top touchline toward the bottom touchline. We will make those coordinates explicit in separate columns.\n",
    "\n",
    "Second, the `period` field matters a great deal in this match:\n",
    "\n",
    "- period $1$ = first half,\n",
    "- period $2$ = second half,\n",
    "- periods $3$ and $4$ = extra time,\n",
    "- period $5$ = penalty shootout.\n",
    "\n",
    "A player passing network built for period $1$ is answering a very different question from one built for periods $1$ through $4$ together.\n"
   ]
  },
