    "### 7.5 PageRank: who is important because important teammates find them?\n",
    "\n",
    "PageRank is a directed prestige measure. In weighted form, a common expression is\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "PR(i) = \\alpha \\sum_{j \\to i} \\frac{w_{ji}}{s_j^{out}} PR(j) + \\frac{1 - \\alpha}{N},\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "where:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $PR(i)$ is the PageRank score of node $i$,\n",
    "- $\\alpha$ is a damping factor, often $0.85$,\n",
    "- $j \\to i$ means a pass edge from $j$ to $i$,\n",
    "- $w_{ji}$ is the weight on that edge,\n",
    "- $s_j^{out} = \\sum_k w_{jk}$ is node $j$'s outgoing strength,\n",
    "- and $N$ is the number of nodes."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
